<title>USA: OpTel says extends deadline for offer.</title>
<headline>OpTel says extends deadline for offer.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>OpTel Inc, majority owned by Videotron Groupe Ltee, said Friday it extended its offer to exchange its 13 percent senior notes due 2005 series B for the outstanding 13 percent senior notes due 2005.</p>
<p>As of June 19, no 13 percent senior notes due 2005 had been tendered pursuant the exchange offer.</p>
<p>OpTel provides cable television services.</p>
</text>
